What's in this repository besides source code:

- Sound clips. The built-in boards (presets/ and the copies under app/src/main/assets/
  and app/src/debug/assets/) hold voice clips. Some are recordings of the project's
  contributors in their own voices, included with their permission; others, and the
  chime (presets/chimes/chime.wav), were generated with ElevenLabs. They are part of
  this work and are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 like the code.
- Icons. The launcher icon and the web app icons (app/src/main/res/, and
  web/src/wasmJsMain/resources/icons/) were made for this project with the help of
  Claude, an AI model from Anthropic.
- Fonts. Atkinson Hyperlegible and Lexend are bundled under the SIL Open Font License,
  Version 1.1. They keep their own licenses; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Third-party libraries and fonts are listed, with their licenses, in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
